>> title: Pan-fried Salmon with Greens
>> servings: 2
>> tags: main, fish, quick
>> time: 25 minutes

Pat @salmon fillets{2} dry and season with @salt{1%tsp} and @black pepper{0.5%tsp}.

Fry skin-side down in @olive oil{1%tbsp} in a #frying pan{} for ~{5%minutes}, then flip for ~{2%minutes}.

Wilt @spinach{200%g} with @garlic{1%clove} and @butter{15%g} in the same pan.

Serve with @lemon{1} wedges and @new potatoes{400%g}.
